window.products.push({"id":552106,"name":"Way Basics 2-Shelf Cube Book Case, Vinyl LP Record Album Storage (Tool-Free Assembly and Uniquely Crafted from Sustainable Non Toxic zBoard Paperboard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":77.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iERgR+bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our 2-shelf vinyl record storage unit is the ideal solution for LP record enthusiasts, but don’t let its name dissuade you from finding other uses for it. It works perfectly for large books that don’t fit on regular bookshelves, large toys, bags, or even chunky sweaters. Made from natural non-toxic materials, it is the perfect organizer for eco-conscious warriors who still care about design and don’t want to go all hippie. Ok, collecting vinyls might be a little hippie, but we’re not here to judge. After all, we designed this thing!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iERgR+bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Way Basics","source_asin":"B089DQ16TN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-552106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089DQ16TN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089DQ16TN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":552107,"name":"HOMKULA Canning Pot Canning Supplies - 8 Piece Canning Kit/Tools Set, Includes 20 Quart Water Bath Canner with Rack and Lid, Tongs, Jar Lifter, Collap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511lG3UGZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【All-in-one Canning Supplies Kit Set】: You’ll get a 20 quart stainless steel canning pot, a large folding canning rack with a diameter of 11.5 inches, a collapsible canning funnel, a canning tongs, a jar wrench，a jar lifter, a bubble remover, a magnetic lid lifter for canning. The perfect canning kits set for beginners with pot is a good helper for you to make various cans. ❤【20 Quart Stainless Steel Canning Pot】: Our heavy duty 20 quart stainless steel canning pot features a triply bottom for even heat distribution. It can be widely used for canning, boiling, souping and steaming. Just turn the rack upside down can be used as a steam rack. ❤【Food Safe & Premium Materials】: Our canning supplies are made of food grade stainless steel and PP. Comfortable grip, non-slip, anti-scald, durable and easy to control. Using tools made from safe materials will keep your cans free of bacteria, making them last longer and safer to eat. ❤【Easy to Clean and Storage】: Our stainless steel kitchen canning kit set has a smooth surface, easy to clean. You can wash it with soapy water or throw it straight into the dishwasher (except lid lifter, magnets don't rust). Air-drying as soon as possible after cleaning is recommended for extended service life. It can be conveniently hung in your cupboard for easy storage and make your kitchen more tidy. ❤【Wide Application】: Our canning pot with rack and lid can help you preserve fresh vegetables and fruits at home by canning, while preserving the essential vitamins and nutrients of food, such as ketchup, strawberry jam, etc. Home canning tools provide you and your family with great food storage and enjoyment year-round.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511lG3UGZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMKULA","source_asin":"B0BN6GZJPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-552107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN6GZJPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN6GZJPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
