window.products.push({"id":552248,"name":"Turkish Blue Evil Eye (Nazar) 3\" Hamsa Hand Elephant Amulet Wall Hanging Home Decor Protection Blessing Housewarming Birthday Gift US Seller","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U3KuDh8+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The evil eye is a curse believed to be cast by a malevolent glare usually given to a person when they are unaware. Many cultures believe that receiving the evil eye will cause misfortune or injury. Talismans created to protect against the evil eye are also called \"evil eyes\". Talismans is an object which is believed to contain certain magical or sacramental properties which would provide good luck for the possessor or possible offer protection from evil or harm. These are meant to \"reflect\" the power of the evil look. Evil eye guards against misfortune and from bad things happening in one's life. It helps to keep your life in balance, protects you from \"bad karma\" and ill-will that could otherwise have a negative effect on your well-being or your life in general. It is believed that if your evil eye amulet cracks or breaks, it has done its job of protecting you from some misfortune or bad luck and should be replaced!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U3KuDh8+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"We pay your sales tax","source_asin":"B00YO3UT00","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-552248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YO3UT00","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YO3UT00","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
