window.products.push({"id":552484,"name":"ANJAYLIA Christmas Lights Battery Operated 50 Counts Clear Mini String Lights with Remote 16.4ft 8 Modes Multicolor LED Fairy Lights Waterproof Indoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fM3HBywhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈【Christmas Lights with Remote Controlled】Light up the upcoming Christmas with 2 set of outdoor Christmas lights which is 16.4 ft (5m) string lights with 50 counts super bright LEDs. It’s super easy to use the remote control the Xmas lights. Lead length is 1.5ft and 0.32ft spacing between every 2 LED. (Package includes: 2 x 16.4ft strings, 2x battery cases, 2 x remotes, 1 x user manual) 🌈【Timer & 8 Modes & Dimmable & Memory】With IR remote, everything's under control. Built-in timer, you can set the clear miniature lights to keep on for 6 hours per day. 8 lighting modes (Combination/Wave/Sequential/Slow Glow/Chasing/Fad/Twinkle/Steady) and 10 adjustable level of brightness. Memory function, the indoor lights will remain at the same setting when turn it on again. 🌈【Waterproof Battery Powered String Lights】Each set of colored string light is operated by 3 AA batteries that output low 4.5V voltage, still cool to touch after long time usage. No extra cord or socket required, safe for families with kids. IP65 waterproof battery case can withstand all the weather through the year which makes the twinkle lighting easy to get powered and portable for indoor & outdoor use. 🌈【Upgraded RGBW LED Beads with Clear Cover】The colors of the led beads are red, green, blue and warm white, well protected by clear cover and reach IP67 waterproof that can be immersed into water, 100% can be used outside. Compared with traditional 12V plug-in incandescent lights or solar powered string lights, LED bead is less prone to burn out which has longer lifespan, stable light source and brightness. 🌈【Green Wire with Energy Saving Copper Core】No matter it is decorated on Christmas tree, garland, wreath or other things, the green wire will not destroy the style. Twisted wires reduce tangles, which means faster installation and more professional appearance. Pure copper core, energy saving, flexible and sturdy, not easy to break apart that can be reused for a long time as interior or exterior decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fM3HBywhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANJAYLIA","source_asin":"B0BYP1TSB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-552484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYP1TSB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYP1TSB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
