window.products.push({"id":552534,"name":"SLASHI 8 Inch Professional Chef’s Knife Set – Sharp Kitchen Knife with Anti Rust Titanium Coating – Stainless Steel Body – Ergonomic Handle – 3 Piece ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717h3Iv7sAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you on the lookout for a sharp, reliable, and comfortable kitchen knife that will get the job done quickly without any hassles? Introducing the SLASHI professional chef's knife set that has been created especially to help make chopping veggies, fruit, and meat in the kitchen a breeze. Our chef’s knife comes in a 3-piece set which includes one 8” chef’s knife, a knife sharpener, and a finger guard, and is sure to be your go-to for all your cutting needs. SLASHI 3 PIECE PROFESSIONAL SET WITH 8” KNIFE SHARPENER & FINGER GUARD -​Made from premium quality materials, our professional cooking knives feature a high carbon stainless steel body and blade with a pakkawood handle. -​The one-piece forging of the cooking knife body gives the knife more strength and reduces the chances of breakage under pressure. -​The blade of this big kitchen knife measures 8\" and is coated with titanium to prevent rusting and is better resistant to natural wear and tear. -​The handle is made with an ergonomic design that offers superior comfort while handling and a non-slip grip that will not hurt the hands when used for long hours. -​This 8-inch kitchen knife has been hand polished to give it a super sharp edge and can be sharpened with the included knife sharpener – sharp kitchen knives! -​This versatile chef knife with sharpener comes as a set of 3 pieces and can be used in your home kitchen, restaurant, bar, café, and more! -​For long life and superior performance, we discourage dishwashing and encourage handwashing of the knife. -​Wrapped in a beautiful gift box that looks classy and sleek, this kitchen knife set makes for one of the best gifts for a cook or culinary enthusiast. WE OFFER A 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEE ON ALL YOUR PURCHASES! So, why think twice? ORDER NOW, to receive our chef’s knife to make life in the kitchen easier and effortless.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717h3Iv7sAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLASHI","source_asin":"B09N6YD5T6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-552534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N6YD5T6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N6YD5T6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
