window.products.push({"id":552636,"name":"Leggett & Platt Danville Complete Bed with Squared Metal Tubing and Buckwheat Upholstered Panels, Coffee Finish, California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TyoUaD4KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Danville offers a sophisticated and charming look that will amaze in any bedroom setting. Constructed of carbon steel for stability and years of everyday use, the upholstered duo panel rectangular 48-inch headboard and 24-inch footboard showcase a lovely transitional style with a contemporary touch that will complement any design or existing décor. A powder coat Coffee finished steel frame houses a (3) section vertical panel design that’s upholstered in elegant Buckwheat toned fabric, creating an interesting look that’s both subtle and appealing. The solid headboard is still functional and sturdy enough to lean back comfortably to read a good book or return a few e-mails before going to bed. The engineered bed frame consists of iron rails, cross arms and (6) feet to provide full support to the California King sized mattress and box spring (sold separately). A good ornamental (or fashionable) bed will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent your other bedroom furniture and transform a room from ordinary into something interesting and sophisticated. The Danville’s straight lines and rich finish with attract the eye and provide the stunning centerpiece your master suite or guestroom has been waiting for. This is a King sized bed that includes a California King sized bed frame. This unit measures 48-inches (H) x 77-inches (W) x 91-inches (L), includes a headboard panel, footboard panel, California King bed frame, instructions, and hardware bag with everything needed for bed assembly. The Fashion Bed Group Danville Complete Bed comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. The Fashion Bed Group, a division of globally diversified Leggett & Platt Inc., is an industry leader in the production of fashionable beds, adjustable bed bases, top of bed textiles, bedding support and barstools. Fashion Bed Group stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes and innovative designs to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TyoUaD4KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B016J47L1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-552636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016J47L1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016J47L1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
