window.products.push({"id":552998,"name":"Two Hedgehogs Real Rose Dipped 24K Gold, Anniversary Valentines Gift for Wife, with Crystal Stand (Luster Teal Blue Rose Bud)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3-3-oFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Attention ： It is a gift for your most beloved one, not for everyone. Only if all the answers to the three questions are yes, could you be recommended to buy this gift: Question 1 : Is she the most important person in your life? Question 2 : Do you love her so much and desire to know her better and to love her deeper? Question 3 : For this purpose, would you mind opening your heart, even showing her your hurts deep inside your heart? What's the occasion for this gift? Occasions to express deep love: wedding proposals, anniversaries, Valentine’s day. The Brand Profile of Two Hedgehogs Two Hedgehogs symbolizes \"deep love.\" It is dedicated to exploring the philosophy of thorns and love through gifts and supplies related to love. We encourage people who are in love to read the thorns together, to find their inner self, and to truly understand the other party, so as to love each other deeply and to live a happier life. Two Hedgehogs has strict requirements on truth and beauty. We also integrate our sincere faith of love and good wishes into our rose gifts. If someone gives you a Two Hedgehogs gift, he is saying to you: You are as beautiful and true as this rose. I am taking actions to understand you better and to love you more deeply. After-sales Service 1. A 30-day no-reason return policy is provided. 2. A five-year warranty for manufacturing defects in materials and workmanship is available. Every warranted item can be replaced within 5 years of the order. Only original, unaltered and unmodified items and workmanship are covered. This warranty does not cover damage caused by accident, improper care, negligence, or the natural fading of the color. This warranty does not cover minor flaws on the natural petals and leaves, which reflects the natural features of real roses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3-3-oFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Two Hedgehogs","source_asin":"B09DBJRM98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-552998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DBJRM98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DBJRM98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
